misaki English lexicons and G2P port
====================================

en_us.lex.zlib and en_gb.lex.zlib hold the entries of misaki 0.9.4's
misaki/data/us_gold.json, us_silver.json, gb_gold.json and gb_silver.json,
re-encoded by build_lexicon.py. The pronunciations are unchanged.

src/g2p/misaki/ in this crate is a Rust port of misaki 0.9.4's misaki/en.py
(the Lexicon and G2P classes after spaCy tagging). The port changes the
language and the data encoding. It keeps the behavior.

